intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAZAMOTO, AKIRA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MAEDA, KENICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OGAWA, KOUHEI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A large-capacity tank type container for which sufficient strength can be ensured and that is externally protectable and can efficiently transport polycarbonate resin pellets both by land and by sea. The container comprises a long-sized, lying-flat drum type tank body (3), and a square box-like container frame (5) surrounding the tank body, the tank body being provided at the upper front end with a charge pipe (20) and at the rear lower end with a discharge pipe (21) and being externally provided with an air feeder for feeding compressed air used to discharge polycarbonate resin pellets. These tank body, charge pipe, discharge pipe and air feeder are stored in a space surrounded by the container frame, and a locking metal fixture (6) is engageable with a locking mechanism on the deck (4) of a trailer.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un conteneur-réservoir de grande capacité, de résistance suffisante, et protégeant de l'extérieu, servant au transport par terre ou par mer de pastilles de résine de polycarbonate. Ledit conteneur comprend un corps (3) allongé cylindrique horizontal et un cadre parallélipipédique (5) entourant le corps lequel est muni à son à son extrémité frontale supérieure d'un tuyau (20) de chargement et à son extrémité arrière inférieure d'un tuyau (21) de déchargement, et pourvu extérieurement d'une arrivée d'air comprimé servant à décharger les pastilles. Le corps (3), les tuyaux, et l'arrivée d'air sont logés à l'intérieur du cadre qui est de plus muni de fixations métalliques (6) d'arrimage s'engageant dans des éléments de verrouillage correspondant disposés sur la plate-forme (4) d'une remorque.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>